{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological horror set in a Lovecraftian setting, blending with the cold reality of a military submarine trapped in the depths of the North Atlantic. This story follows ordinary people pushed to the brink of madness as they encounter the unthinkable horrors beneath the waves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOVECRAFTIAN HORROR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/54dff2caeb5d25214c1e0170d9fdb2a2.poster.avif?t=1772799679\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/54dff2caeb5d25214c1e0170d9fdb2a2.webm?t=1772799679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/54dff2caeb5d25214c1e0170d9fdb2a2.mp4?t=1772799679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient forces have awakened beneath the ocean, and all contact with the surface is lost. Seek answers at the heart of an apocalypse aboard a nuclear submarine. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE HARD CHOICES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/55bab55ea4a59b1489aecaa8614a51e6.poster.avif?t=1772799679\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/55bab55ea4a59b1489aecaa8614a51e6.webm?t=1772799679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/55bab55ea4a59b1489aecaa8614a51e6.mp4?t=1772799679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every crew member is more than just an asset. They are human beings, haunted by their own fears and suffering. You have to make hard choice \u2013 complete the mission or preserve your humanity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE IN CHARGE NOW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/dc33e77a6aa8fbd45a5228c862808db3.poster.avif?t=1772799679\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/dc33e77a6aa8fbd45a5228c862808db3.webm?t=1772799679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/dc33e77a6aa8fbd45a5228c862808db3.mp4?t=1772799679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the captain\u2019s right hand. Assign tasks, maintain discipline, and don\u2019t let madness overcome your mind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOK INTO THE ABYSS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/c8a1420a287b4d209fa270112bea0d09.poster.avif?t=1772799679\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/c8a1420a287b4d209fa270112bea0d09.webm?t=1772799679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/c8a1420a287b4d209fa270112bea0d09.mp4?t=1772799679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan the depths with sonar. But remember, not everything in the ocean follows military protocol\u2026 Is it another submarine, or something alive?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4042160?t=1772799679","background_raw":"https://shared.ak